{"articleNo":"2033","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=2033&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2011-2012 스리랑카 정부초청 장학생 선발 요강","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.09.23","hit":"8453","attachments":[{"name":"2011-2012 스리랑카 정부초청 장학생 선발요강.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=2033&attachNo=69511"},{"name":"장학생 지원서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=2033&attachNo=71430"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t스리랑카 정부에서 학부 및 대학원 과정에 2명의 장학생을 초청하오니,&nbsp;우리 학생들의 많은 참여 부탁합니다.&nbsp;<br><br><!--StartFragment-->\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">2011-2012 스리랑카 정부초청 장학생 선발요강 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '바탕'\">&nbsp; 1. 선발 과정</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '바탕'\"> : 학사, 석사/박사과정&nbsp;</span></font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '바탕'\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '바탕'\">&nbsp; 2. 선발 인원</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '바탕'\"> : 2명 (학사 1명, 석사/박사과정 1명)</span></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '바탕'\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;*과정별 추천인원은 변경될 수 있음. &nbsp;</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '바탕'\">&nbsp; 3. 지원 자격</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '바탕'\"> </span></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 대한민국 국민</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 9.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 스리랑카 영주권자는 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">지원할 수 없음.</span></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 9.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 스리랑카 정부초청 장학생 입학자격에 충족하는 자</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;<br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font face=\"굴림\">4. 장학생 수용 대학</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 9.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;페라데니아대학(University of Peradeniya) 등</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 9.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;* 관련 사이트 www.mohe.gov.lk</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '바탕'\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;5. 장학금 수혜기간 및 시작 시기</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 장학금 수혜 기간: &nbsp;1년 - 4년 (첨부 문서 참조)&nbsp;&nbsp;<br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 나. 시작 시기</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 9.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 2012년 대학별 학기 시작일 기준 &nbsp;</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 6.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 6.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font face=\"굴림\">6. 장학금 수혜내역</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 수업료 전액</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 의료비 : 치과 관련 치료비 제외</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 월 생활비 : 생활비- 월 스리랑카화 30,000 루피 </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;식비, 월세-월 스리랑카화 30,000 루피</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 항공료는 본인 부담임. </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 7.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font face=\"굴림\">7. 장학생 수용대학별 선발요건: 첨부 문서 참조</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 6.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font face=\"굴림\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 7.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font face=\"굴림\">8. 기타 장학생 수혜조건 및 유의사항: 첨부 문서 참조<br></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '바탕'\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;9. 지원방법 및 마감일 </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 지원 마감 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2011. 9. 30(금) 18:00</span></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 제출 서류</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1)지원서 A (본원 소정 양식) </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2)지원서 B (스리랑카 소정 양식) </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3)졸업증명서&nbsp;</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;4)성적증명서</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;5)어학 증명서(IELTS 6.0 이상, TOEFL 525 이상 등) </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;* 상기 증명서가 없을 경우 TEPS, TOEIC 증명을 송부.</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;6)건강 진단서 (스리랑카 소정 양식) </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;7)지원자 DB 파일 </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;8)증명사진 스캔 1매 </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;*1), 7), 8)을 제외한 서류는 모두 영문으로 작성되어야 함. </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-지원서 A (본원 소정 양식)를 고교 혹은, 대학에서 발급받아 9. 30(금)까지</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">개인이 스캔+파일을 압축 파일로 송부</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"> (파일명: 스리-학,석(박)-홍길동.zip)</span></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;oijung@mest.go.kr</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;* 1차 합격자는 제출 서류 중 2)-6) 서류를 순서대로 철하여 원본1부+ 사본 1</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;부를 구성하여 2011. 10. 7 (금)까지 본원으로 우송함.&nbsp;</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 합격자 발표 : 스리랑카 교육부의 통보에 따름.</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><br></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
